{"title":"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 15","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be a point inside isosceles right triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/1/a51c0837bd534b50599134cc04878a67ee200bde.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle C = 90^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" /> , <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/e/61eef06ff6002e6e8c6a98d23c957be896f27ddd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/c/33ce5fcbd44faa9cf04a702136c46182b6146849.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/1/3b197f839fa6d467fb1464623df15b0f7d0d446d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CP = 6\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" />. Find the area of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2a559986ed5a0ffc5654bd367c29dfc92913c36.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ABC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2007AlabamaARMLTST15.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/c/c2/2007AlabamaARMLTST15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"318\" height=\"411\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> be the reflections of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> over sides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/5/6c52a41dcbd739f1d026c5d4f181438b75b76976.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BC$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/5/e657259c0995d2c36d46744bb4aa81471e6575ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$CA$\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/e/57ee5125358c0606c9b588580ddfa66f83e607b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"30\" height=\"14\" />, respectively. We then have that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/4/f3434cac8930b1406e9599825dad2b0d81ac562b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[AEC]=[APC]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/8/7a87eec99c7a792a9b593bc094ed89050e4b8310.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[FAB]=[PAB]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"127\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/1/aa10a26731778a823669ea8ac0a2d2716159e2d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BCD]=[BCP]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />. This shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/d/f3d6838ad8a7b242a0d4f9937594fee2f4f16382.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[AECDBF]=2[ABC]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"181\" height=\"18\" />. I shall now proceed to find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/a/cba37e2a31ce826f907cddf65c1bd565ac225b9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[AECDBF]$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"95\" height=\"18\" />. This is equal to\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/1/2b1c0b03a9a1feec8a2f3edcdde0f39c92e7d140.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[AECDBF]=[AEF]+[BDF]+[DEF]\\]\" width=\"323\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/6/a0629236af10ec38301a19bce62e7f794a21b34b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle CAE=\\angle CAP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"136\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/d/5cd50634dddfa31e59fa8ca60ecffbd9d0819e49.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle BAP=\\angle BAF$\" width=\"134\" height=\"13\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/3/513dcdf2832140b3beb0697b89605de3ac3508e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle EAF=2\\angle CAB=90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"192\" height=\"13\" />. Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/6/086fd1ff2c6783e8d56b514be442a4243124e635.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle FBD=90^{\\circ}$\" width=\"105\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/9/639fed317a0842755ba14e4c5635e754c03e3c58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle DCE=180^{\\circ}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"114\" height=\"13\" />. Now note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/e/e8e4e0ce52a6a2312ec6a9ae7363410a50878b5a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AE=AF=AP=5$\" width=\"165\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/d/07d41244f337db91ee28d3962e89a3c38088aaec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BD=BF=BP=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"178\" height=\"13\" />. Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/1/6d130cf14314b7cd74a17ff5ade06157431f7020.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[AEF]=\\frac{25}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"97\" height=\"37\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/d/f1de0009a5ac04ddd1267aba019d322f40f788a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[BDF]=\\frac{169}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"108\" height=\"37\" />. Also note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/e/c2ee5e63471e5418d62db00bfbaf4aecd7f260dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$EF=5\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"86\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/a/e6a4d2c65ee4ff3bf4f4402668e7c67ab864652a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DF=13\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"97\" height=\"18\" />. We also know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> are collinear, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/0/270a92e5973884c9fbddc78ce78eec471346c445.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DE=EC+CD=2CP=12\\sqrt{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"264\" height=\"18\" />. This shows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/9/2e9e8b2c23e0545ef6de81f0ea578173e9ab7a64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$DEF$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> is a 5-12-13 right triangle, so it has area <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/2/b128028831d10958ff0a92ee7144df0de6cb9a53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{EF\\cdot DE}{2}=60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"117\" height=\"37\" />, so\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/7/b57b993ea4c9cc9c6b1b6a20e26f935f1265e957.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[[ABC]=\\frac{[AECDBF]}{2}=\\frac{\\frac{25}{2}+\\frac{169}{2}+60}{2}=\\boxed{\\frac{157}{2}}\\]\" width=\"375\" height=\"48\" />\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Rotate the diagram by 90 degrees about <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> so that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> goes to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> goes to a point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> goes to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/3545551b3d62c4e23d5df7352a55602d0aa9adcd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P&#39;$\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Since the image of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/7/f874b39870586f0504f50a667f2bafedddf47904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$BP$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" /> under this rotation is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/9/e09be993ec778aceb629bea824d4fca16dce340d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP&#39;$\" width=\"31\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/2/2d208938f4a0e90f9c2c095d69c7188598c8129f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AP&#39; = 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"74\" height=\"14\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/c/9ac9aa35ba55bd89231db2687f3f931fcf3ae5c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\triangle PCP&#39;$\" width=\"62\" height=\"14\" /> is a 45-45-90 right triangle, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/a/4ba07673ee2ef5750d231b1aa8aad96ad61730aa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$PP&#39; = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/b/bdb200f1d77781ab578418fe327770ff92a8ce00.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$APP&#39;$\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> is a 5-12-13 right triangle, with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/2/d929bcc54f360f9c6210890e68f4d004e168193b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APP&#39; = 90^\\circ$\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/6/7663c34084b3e015fa0aff5d661ee04de4742ec2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle APC = \\angle APP&#39; + PP&#39;C = 90^\\circ + 45^\\circ = 135^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"363\" height=\"15\" />, so by Law of Cosines on triangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/9/4d91d2a29d7b4556be19a003b0f830b700cdf92d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$APC$\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" />, \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/1/89187dc8914035a33b24ff32009354e492ed4874.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[AC^2 = AP&#39;^2 + P&#39;C^2  - 2(AP&#39;)(P&#39;C)\\cos 135^\\circ = 25 + 72 - 2(-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}) (6\\sqrt{2})(5) = 157,\\]\" width=\"616\" height=\"41\" /> \n</p><p>so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c4778135387e43afc1d5cf5f482322441414a686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$[ABC] = \\frac{AC^2}{2} = \\boxed{\\frac{157}{2}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"183\" height=\"48\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_15&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST\">2007 Alabama ARML TST</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems\">(Problems)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 14\">Problem 14</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b>Last Problem</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Alabama_ARML_TST_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2007 Alabama ARML TST Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">15</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017213602\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.067 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 345/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1339/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 214/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 9983/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.978      1 Template:ARML_box\n100.00%    6.978      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10187:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017213602 and revision id 93370. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}